@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.342 = private unnamed_addr constant [339 x i8] c"Enforce a requirement on the version of Ruff, to enforce at runtime.\0AIf the version of Ruff does not meet the requirement, Ruff will exit\0Awith an error.\0A\0AUseful for unifying results across many environments, e.g., with a\0A`pyproject.toml` file.\0A\0AAccepts a [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) specifier, like `==0.3.1` or `>=0.3.1`.", align 1
