@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.1322 = private unnamed_addr constant [528 x i8] c"A list of decorators that, when applied to a method, indicate that the\0Amethod should be treated as a class method (in addition to the builtin\0A`@classmethod`).\0A\0AFor example, Ruff will expect that any method decorated by a decorator\0Ain this list takes a `cls` argument as its first argument.\0A\0AExpects to receive a list of fully-qualified names (e.g., `pydantic.validator`,\0Arather than `validator`) or alternatively a plain name which is then matched against\0Athe last segment in case the decorator itself consists of a dotted name.", align 1
