@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.1335 = private unnamed_addr constant [368 x i8] c"A list of names (or patterns) to ignore when considering `pep8-naming` violations.\0A\0ASupports glob patterns. For example, to ignore all names starting with `test_` or ending with `_test`, you could use `ignore-names = [\22test_*\22, \22*_test\22]`. For more information on the glob syntax, refer to the [`globset` documentation](https://docs.rs/globset/latest/globset/#syntax).", align 1
